    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d266">

                <pb facs="0253" n="241" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg241"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.01A/176: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-06-26T15:00:00+03:25">June 26, 1942—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 26—11:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>316. Reference my telegram 191, June 9 and despatch 279, June 11.<anchor n="17"
                        xml:id="d266-f1"/> Prime Minister called me today to express his deep
                    concern over <pb facs="0254" n="242" xml:id="pg242"/> failure of American
                    Government to respond to his many requests for advisers, particularly Food
                    Administrator and financial mission. He said he had promised the Majlis on
                    occasion of expulsion of Japanese Legation<anchor n="18" xml:id="d266-f2"/> and
                    when other action favorable to Allies was taken that effective aid from United
                    States would soon be forthcoming. He added in evident agitation that he is
                    “getting near the end of his rope” and that his position may soon become
                    untenable unless American help is extended.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
